30
00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:31.916
porque ella sabe

31
00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:32.416
¡somos culpables!

32
00:00:32.625 --> 00:00:33.000
Suficiente.

33
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.416
todos calmarse

34
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:35.916
Sabemos que sufriste

35
00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:37.125
Pedir disculpas en público,

36
00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:37.958
aclara esto,

37
00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:38.875
